        "line": 140,
        "text": "def ZeroMassesOn (U : Set Plane) (u : State Point) : Prop := ∀ n s, s ∈ U → CorrectionState.radialMoment 2 u.mean.angular n s = 0 ∧ CorrectionState.radialMoment 1 u.mean.axial n s = 0"
